# Main Components & Entry Point

*   **Entry Point:** The simulation is likely loaded and run via [index.html](mdc:index.html).
*   **Environment:** 
    *   The day/night cycle is managed by [Day-Night_Cycle.js](mdc:Day-Night_Cycle.js).
    *   The landscape/background is handled by [landscape.js](mdc:landscape.js).
*   **Spawning:** Food spawning logic resides in [food_spawner.js](mdc:food_spawner.js).
*   **Debugging/Inspection:** An inspector tool seems available in [inspector.js](mdc:inspector.js).

